$comment
  C4 variant vcd (RSpice-authored; corpus design C4): the edges the ports
  variant's pulse sources make through the 0.9 V A/D threshold. clk rises at
  0.5 ns + k 100 ns and falls 50 ns later; start falls at 50.5 ns + m us and
  rises at 949.5 ns + m us.
$end
$timescale 100ps $end
$scope module tb $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
$var wire 1 " start $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
